Priority: optional
Maintainer: mohamedation <mohamedation@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 10), cmake, librtlsdr-dev, libasound2-dev, libpulse-dev, libfreetype-dev, libc6-dev, nlohmann-json3-dev
Standards-Version: 4.1.3

Package: zdr
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, pipewire-alsa, libasound2-plugins
Description: Lightweight SDR interface for Cardputer Zero / Raspberry Pi
 A graphical SDR application for small framebuffer displays (Cardputer Zero,
 Raspberry Pi). Supports RTL-SDR devices with spectrum/waterfall and
 FM/NFM/AM/USB/LSB demodulation. Audio uses the PipeWire ALSA PCM
 (pipewire-alsa) so it shares the codec with APPLaunch.
 .
 Features:
  - Real-time spectrum analyzer and waterfall display
  - FM/NFM/AM/USB/LSB audio demodulation
  - Volume control and squelch detection
  - Optimized for Cardputer Zero (CM0) and Raspberry Pi
